  "prefLabel": "Ed 1117.07 Transfer of Student Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1117.07 Transfer of Student Records.\n\n(a) Whenever a court makes or changes a child’s court ordered residential placement that results in a change in the educational placement, the liable school district shall immediately provide a copy of all necessary educational records of the child including, but not limited to, the child’s current IEP and evaluations.\n\nSource. #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed1100.html"
